            "html": "<article id=\"post-28684\" class=\"post-28684 post type-post status-publish format-quote hentry post_format-post-format-quote category-diario tag-china tag-democracia tag-ditadura tag-pl-fake-news tag-russia tag-stf\"><header class=\"entry-header\"><div class=\"entry-meta\"><span class=\"cat-links\"><a href=\"cat.html#diario\" rel=\"category\">Diário</a></span></div><h1 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"2023-05-03-diario-03-05-2023.html\" rel=\"bookmark\">No Brasil de 2023 você só pode ser a favor do governo</a></h1><div class=\"entry-meta\"><span class=\"post-format\"><a class=\"entry-format\" href=\"type.html#quote\">Citação</a></span> <span class=\"entry-date\"><a href=\"2023-05-03-diario-03-05-2023.html\" rel=\"bookmark\"><time class=\"entry-date\" datetime=\"2023-05-03T11:15:56-03:00\">03/05/2023</time></a></span> <span class=\"byline\"><span class=\"author vcard\"><a class=\"url fn n\" href=\"/\" rel=\"author\">estranhosidade</a></span></span> <span class=\"comments-link\"><a href=\"2023-05-03-diario-03-05-2023.html#respond\">Deixe um comentário</a></span></div><div class=\"entry-meta tag-links-top\"><span class=\"tag-links\"><a href=\"tag.html#china\" rel=\"tag\">China</a> <a href=\"tag.html#democracia\" rel=\"tag\">Democracia</a> <a href=\"tag.html#ditadura\" rel=\"tag\">Ditadura</a> <a href=\"tag.html#pl-fake-news\" rel=\"tag\">PL Fake News</a> <a href=\"tag.html#russia\" rel=\"tag\">Rússia</a> <a href=\"tag.html#stf\" rel=\"tag\">STF</a> </span><span class=\"tag-ellipsis\" style=\"display: none;\">...</span></div></header><!-- .entry-header --><div class=\"entry-content\"><blockquote>\n<h2><a href=\"https://archive.is/2023.05.02-190608/https://g1.globo.com/politica/blog/julia-duailibi/post/2023/05/02/moraes-manda-pf-ouvir-presidentes-de-big-techs-por-causa-de-anuncios-contra-pl-das-fake-news.ghtml#:~:text=removam%20an%C3%BAncios%20e%20textos%20contra%20PL\">Moraes manda PF ouvir presidentes de big techs por causa de anúncios contra PL das Fake News[&#8230;]no mesmo despacho, Moraes definiu que as empresas removam anúncios contra projeto de lei (PL) das Fake News</a></h2>\n</blockquote>\n<p>No Brasil de 2023 você só pode ser a favor do governo. Tipo como ocorre na democracia chinesa e russa.</p>\n</div></article>",
